msgid "Consent is enforced where the data is held. The VHL Sharer enforces the consent in its own Consent Registry (IHE PCF ). A copy of a consent carried inside a document is evidence only. See Process A and Process C."
msgstr ""

#. Source: input/pagecontent/security-privacy.md:6
